  "body": "Tender: Closes on Tuesday 3 November 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\n10-Year Stamford Insurance Building Warranty | CCC & Title Issued\r\n\r\nStunning, brand new and thoughtfully designed, this inspired residence combines contemporary style, exceptional comfort and an unbeatable North Shore location. Bathed in natural sunlight, this impressive two-level home offers generous space and flexibility for modern family living.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nBrand-new two-level home with CCC and title issued, backed by a 10-year Stamford Insurance Building Warranty\r\n\r\nThree spacious living areas, providing plenty of room for family relaxation, entertaining and versatile everyday living\r\n\r\nFive generous double bedrooms and 3.5 beautifully appointed bathrooms\r\n\r\nTwo master suites, conveniently positioned on both levels to provide flexibility for extended family, guests or different lifestyle needs\r\n\r\nTwo designer kitchens with quality finishes and excellent functionality, ideal for families who love cooking and entertaining\r\n\r\nBright, expansive interiors with excellent natural light and a welcoming sense of space\r\n\r\nSeamless indoor-outdoor flow to a sunny deck, creating a private setting for entertaining or relaxing\r\n\r\nDouble internal-access garage with secure parking and excellent storage\r\n\r\nExceptional North Shore Location\r\nEnjoy effortless connectivity with easy access to bus routes, motorways and the nearby Park & Ride. Albany, Browns Bay and Long Bay are all within easy reach, offering an excellent selection of shopping, cafés, restaurants and entertainment.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate the proximity to quality local schools, beautiful beaches, parks and playgrounds, making everyday living both convenient and enjoyable.0-Year Stamford Insurance Building Warranty | CCC & Title Issued\r\n\r\nStunning, brand new and thoughtfully designed, this inspired residence combines contemporary style, exceptional comfort and an unbeatable North Shore location. Bathed in natural sunlight, this impressive two-level home offers generous space and flexibility for modern family living.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nBrand-new two-level home with CCC and title issued, backed by a 10-year Stamford Insurance Building Warranty\r\n\r\nThree spacious living areas, providing plenty of room for family relaxation, entertaining and versatile everyday living\r\n\r\nFive generous double bedrooms and 3.5 beautifully appointed bathrooms\r\n\r\nTwo master suites, conveniently positioned on both levels to provide flexibility for extended family, guests or different lifestyle needs\r\n\r\nTwo designer kitchens with quality finishes and excellent functionality, ideal for families who love cooking and entertaining\r\n\r\nBright, expansive interiors with excellent natural light and a welcoming sense of space\r\n\r\nSeamless indoor-outdoor flow to a sunny deck, creating a private setting for entertaining or relaxing\r\n\r\nDouble internal-access garage with secure parking and excellent storage\r\n\r\nExceptional North Shore Location\r\nEnjoy effortless connectivity with easy access to bus routes, motorways and the nearby Park & Ride. Albany, Browns Bay and Long Bay are all within easy reach, offering an excellent selection of shopping, cafés, restaurants and entertainment.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate the proximity to quality local schools, beautiful beaches, parks and playgrounds, making everyday living both convenient and enjoyable.\r\n\r\nCombining generous accommodation, thoughtful design and an enviable location, this exceptional home delivers the space, flexibility and lifestyle modern families are looking for.\r\n\r\nSimply move in, relax and enjoy the best of North Shore living.",
